{"pin":"BH05837","subcodes":[{"code":"BH05837","anchor":"","first_line":"We have read thy letter and have ordained for thee that which thou didst ask of God, thy Lord and the Lord of all worlds, and inscribed for thee [3.5s]... ...Magnified be Thy name, O Lord my God, inasmuch as Thou hast inclined mine ear to Thy voice, and called me to Thyself","first_line_orig":"قد قرئنا کتابک و قدرنا لک ما سئلت به الله ربک و رب العالمین و رقم لک... ای ربّ لک الحمد علی ما اسمعتنی ندائک  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"170","translations":[{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"writing_refs":[{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15739.281","source":"BLIB_Or15739","locator":"281"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA35:021b","source":"INBA35","locator":"021b","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v035/?page=13"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA48:156","source":"INBA48","locator":"156","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v048/?page=158"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA57:077x","source":"INBA57","locator":"077x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v057/?page=79"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ1.117x","source":"AQMJ1","locator":"117x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ1/mmq1-119.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"PMP#074x","source":"PMP","locator":"074x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/103853102"},{"kind":"translation","code":"PM#074x","source":"PM","locator":"074x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/556046846"}]}]}
